## Principles
Evidence-driven per-iteration debug loop,mandatory reference comparison. No new server/PD launch required. Same-shape baseline first;align synthetic state only from exact source evidence. Never force numbers to match or claim correctness from speed alone. Respect client TPOT=(latency-TTFT)/(OSL-1) versus internal full-loop amortization. Report batch refill/tail/overlap/hardware differences. Read runtime/spec/env skills before related edits. One independent reference-research teammate,leader owns implementation verification/GPU. English files,Chinese user reports.
